:: Pub Approach Widgets [widget]

<<widget "pubapproach">>
	<<set $xchange.pubtimer to random(10,30)>><<set $pubdrink to 0>><<set $pubresist to 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $NPCList[0].skills.security += (1000 - $submissive) / 4>>

	<span class="purple"><<= $pub_tf? "Having witnessed your transformation just now, a": "A">> <<person>> approaches you.</span><br>
	<<cheesy-pickup-line>>

	<<unset $pub_tf>>
	<br><br>

	<<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">><<set _hasPromiscuity to 0>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
		<<set _hasPromiscuity to 1>>
		<<link [[Smile (0:10)|Pub Approach Flirt]]>><<pass 10>><<handheldon>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
	<<else>>
		You're not promiscuous enough to reciprocate.
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if ($arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 and $drunk lt 240) or !_hasPromiscuity>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<<elseif $willpowerSuccess>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><<willpowersuccess>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $pubresist to 0>>
		<span class="lewd">You're too <<= $arousal gte $arousalmax * 3/5? "horny" : "drunk">> to resist <<his>> advances.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Pub Approach Flirt
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<set $bus to "harvest">>
<<promiscuity2>>
You smile to <<his>> approach, encouraging <<him>> to continue. 
<br><br>

<<chitchat>> Time goes by swiftly as you both chat.
<br><br>

"You know, you really are quite a <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? ["sexy chick", "hot girl", "hot babe", "sex bomb", "sweet piece of tail"].random() : ["handsome guy", "sexy hunk of ass", "hot stud", "stallion"].random()>>. <<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "" : "H-">>How about going somewhere more... private?" <<he>> shoots <<his>> lusty proposal. "<<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "" : "I-">>If you'll allow it."  
<br><br>

<<switch $speech_attitude>>
<<case "meek">>
	"I-I wouldn't mind..." you meekly respond while contemplating in your mind the extent of the depravity about to befall your poor little self. Despite the countless lewd fantasies rapidly coursing through your head, or perhaps precisely because of them, you still decide to follow <<him>> deeper into the restrooms.
<<case "neutral">>
	"I thought you'd never ask," you say while mockingly faking surprise. "Come on, let's go." There isn't much to think about, so you just follow <<him>> deeper into the restrooms.
<<case "bratty">>
	"We better get going, then," you respond, drawing a cheeky smile. "This <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? "girl" : ($player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "boy" : "person") >> isn't gonna service <<pherself>>." The <<person>> is stunned for a few moments before your sudden boldness. After shaking off <<his>> shock, and against <<his>> better judgement, <<he>> follows you into the restrooms.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Pub Approach Flirt 2]]>><</link>>

:: Pub Approach Flirt 2

Perhaps it's <<his>> <<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "charisma" : "cute awkwardness">>, or perhaps you're just horny. But either way, <<hes>> managed to get through your defences and convince you to get frisky with <<him>>.
<br><br>

As you get past the door, you're both met with the sounds of several lustful people engaging in sloppy sex. Each pair only obscured by their stall. Moans and slick pounding echo across the room, announcing to anyone coming in that this room is not for relieving oneself. At least not primarily, it seems. <<arousal 50>><<garousal>>
<br><br>

<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
	With implicit confidence, <<he>> guides you to an empty stall as if <<he>> had reserved it beforehand. The stall is unnaturally clean, in a way that barely makes any sense for a public restroom. Or at least, in terms of the usual filth you'd expect in a toilet. It doesn't stink of pee, but of sex. 
	<br><br>
	No longer able to restrain <<himself>>, the <<person>> lunges into you as <<he>> deftly locks the door behind <<him>>, and begins to grope you all over.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Pub Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	With clear awkwardness, <<he>> discreetly checks each stall looking for an empty one. And <<he>> lights up once <<he>> manages to find one. With a signal beckons you over, and you go in. The stall is unnaturally clean, in a way that barely makes any sense for a public restroom. Or at least, in terms of the usual filth you'd expect in a toilet. It doesn't stink of pee, but of sex. 
	<br><br>
	No longer able to control <<himself>>, the <<person>> lunges into you, having locked the door beforehand, and begins to grope you all over with panting lust.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Pub Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

