:: Pub Approach Sex Finish

<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>

		<<tearful>> you knock <<him>> into the door, which gives way under <<his>> weight. And dash out the room, and back into the main hall, paying no mind to anything you might have left behind.

	<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>

		<<ejaculation>>
		<<clotheson>>

		<<He>> collapses over you. "I really, really needed that," <<he>> says, stroking your hair. "Let's keep this between just the two of us, though." <<He>> glances at <<his>> watch. "My spouse should be returning home any time soon. So I better hurry home and scrub your scent off myself." <<He>> hastily dresses back up before rushing out. "Really sorry about leaving like this. I promise I won't forget you." <<tearful>> you dress back up before heading out yourself.

	<<else>>
		<<clotheson>>

		"Alright. I knew I was out of practice. Just go so I can wash up before heading back home to my spouse." <<He>> opens the door for you to leave. <<tearful>> you gather your clothes in haste and dress back up before heading out.

	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>

		<<tearful>> you knock <<him>> back against the doors. It gives way and <<he>> tumbles out, letting you escape before <<he>> can get back up. As you reach the main hall, you pay no mind to anything you might have left behind.

	<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>

		<<ejaculation>>
		<<clotheson>>

		<<He>> collapses over you. "That was amazing," <<he>> pants. "You really are an incredible <<= $player.sex is "m"? "guy":"girl">>." <<He>> lifts <<himself>> up, trying to get a good look at you even in this tight space. "Honestly, I'd really love for you to come home with me. Can I perhaps tempt you with some coffee? Perhaps tea?" You tell <<him>> there's no need for it and that you really should be going.
		<br><br>

		"Name's <<personname>>," <<he>> suddenly introduces <<himself>> out of the blue as if hoping this was more than some fling. "I really hope we'll see each other again." Not sparing another word, you quickly dress back up, and apologise for not being able to indulge. <<tearful>> you leave the room. Yet <<he>> still stares after you in longing all the way until you're fully gone.
		
	<<else>>

		<<clotheson>>
		"Huh? What's wrong?" <<he>> asks. "Ugh, nevermind. This was a mistake. Please leave." <<tearful>> you leave <<him>> in peace.

	<</if>>
	<br><br>


	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Pub Approach Reject
<<if $phase is 1>>
	Unimpressed, you shoot down every single one of <<his>> poor attempts at a pick-up line. Mortified that <<he>> would think such cheesy lines would work on you. And somehow, <<he>> still looks shocked that <<his>> clever oneliners missed their mark.
	<br><br>

	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
		"Come on! Don't be like that!" <<he>> protests. "At least let me buy you a drink."
		<br><br>
		<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
			<span class="blue">You can't bring yourself to drink while you know you're with child.</span>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Accept (0:20)|Pub Approach Drink]]>><<alcohol 200>><<pass 20>><<set $pubdrink += 2000>><</link>><<ggalcohol>>
			<br>
			<<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">>
			<<if $arousal lt $arousalmax * 3/5 and $drunk lt 240>>
				<<link [[Refuse|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
			<<elseif $willpowerSuccess and $pubresist>>
				<<link [[Refuse|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<willpowersuccess>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $pubresist to 0>>
				<span class="lewd"><<He>> has worn you down. You're now going along with <<his>> advances.</span>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		Having run out of ammunition, the <<person>> takes <<his>> leave feeling defeated.
		<br>
		<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Despite <<his>> pushiness, you still refuse every attempt <<he>> does to get you to cave. 
	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 750>>
		For a moment it seems the <<person>> is about to lose <<his>> temper, but a stern reminder from Landry across the hall appears to scare the <<person>> off. With a scornful expression, <<he>> clicks <<his>> tongue one last time before going off. 
	<<else>>
		Having knocked out the wind out of <<him>>, <<he>> makes one last scornful remark before going off.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

